  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "3,000 farmers supported",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8FC10F48A9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 49,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "50 tons of food waste prevented every month",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A38C13DE6C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "These numbers represent FarmWorks’s impact over the last five years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA2539E031",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "But what if I tell you they are no longer the most important metrics to me anymore?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4A5FBAFB1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "Today, the number one metric that I care about as CEO of FarmWorks is our profitability.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "001597AC72",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "Now before you judge me and think, \"How did we let this capitalist on the stage?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "262F4BD94A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "hear me out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F74F48CA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "Five years ago, I cofounded FarmWorks with the grand mission to build 1,000 climate-smart, highly productive farms across Kenya.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8FEE6A2BE0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "We invested in water dams, net houses, drip irrigation, organic fertilizers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BD3D6D7E2A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "We had every right climate solution by the book.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0FC799EDC6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 161,
        "text": "But then, harvest time came, and I realized, when walking into our grading shed, there were crates of tomatoes rotting away because we didn't have enough orders.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4AD7CD0398",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Our storage room was bursting with onions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A353D38A1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "It looks almost funny, but I was standing there, thinking, \"Great, now what?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B87C5EEBA7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "At the end of the day, every farmer has to answer one question: \"Who is going to buy my produce and pay for all my hard work and investment?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E296115C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "Without the financial outcomes, climate initiatives cannot sustain themselves.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "519DCEE9F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "This lesson hit me particularly hard",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61C0269A92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "This lesson hit me particularly hard a few years ago during one of our investor visits.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B7FE8D0876",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 42,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "So how do you like working with FarmWorks so far?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "499761ECEF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "The investor asked our group of farmers, \"So how do you like working with FarmWorks so far?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2566F40C16",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "One farmer said, \"Yeah, we like them a lot so far.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4928D5A12A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "But you see, every two years, there is a new organization coming to us with a new project.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2336CD70C5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "They disappear after two years, so we will see how long FarmWorks can last.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D088814EEA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "I felt my stomach drop",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "403C28E50C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "I felt my stomach drop in that moment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23CC1923CE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "countless NGOs, donors, start-ups rolling in with grand climate visions, big promises",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC9A56F902",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "These farmers have gotten used to countless NGOs, donors, start-ups rolling in with grand climate visions, big promises, only to vanish when funding dries up.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F49E941DE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "And without the financial sustainability, we, too, would be gone in just a few seasons.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "198C096F77",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "In that moment, finding financial sustainability for FarmWorks meant we had to sell all of our produce.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A06DCACBEB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "So that's when I threw myself into Kenya's vegetable wholesale market.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB39E20428",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "This is 5am at the Marikiti, one of the largest wholesale markets in downtown Nairobi.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AAFAB1A134",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "It was chaotic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0DF886DDA8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "So many sellers fighting for the best spot to sell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97E9C810FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "The customers are fighting for the highest-quality crate of tomatoes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "73468E9A46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "And I'm Chinese, so I'm very much used to crowds and competition.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "72A602AB1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "But this was next level.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8047841E2A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "(Laughter) I immediately knew I had to be part of this excitement.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8E50A8D1CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 134,
        "text": "I started delivering tomatoes with our trucks to the markets, and on my first day, I got pushed down to the ground by a market vendor.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F54F19D994",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Not exactly the welcome I was expecting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "947B0F8FC5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "But over the years, I learned to be part of the market.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F4FD0D807",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 126,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "market ladies",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60135E2E00",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 212,
        "text": "I figured out how prices actually work, how weather can totally change supply and demand overnight, and made friends with the market ladies, many of them now our customers, proudly selling produce from FarmWorks.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFA99B8CD9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "With the market figured out, we were able to sell almost everything.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C68B56A957",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "In fact, we realized that our own farms could never be enough to meet the full demand.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9E71E3D4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 12,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "people are eating every day of the year, but no farmer can be harvesting 365 days of the year.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9938207D88",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "So we decided to partner with more farmers, starting by training them with climate-smart techniques.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D3B2AA915",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "And this is what surprised me.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBCC7FDAD9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "When we give farmers drip irrigation kits, sometimes they sit unused.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6E1078291",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "When we showed them the more hygienic crop-support structures, they were still using the same old method.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17E79E980E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 49,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "imposing solutions but not really solving problems",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7885AEF063",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "It was hard to admit, but the reality is we were imposing solutions but not really solving problems.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4F44DE54FA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "The drip irrigation could save water but costs fuel to operate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8B9D22AE6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "The more hygienic crop support structure might prevent disease but costs money to buy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BC2AFE412",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "We were providing knowledge, but not really capital or guaranteed returns.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EEE001406E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "And without enough financial incentives, the farmers cannot really afford to implement those good ideas.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AB11AB7956",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "So we changed our approach.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8947760A2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "Instead of focusing on training, we simply started buying and distributing the farmers' produce, and giving them a real income.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B07F28700",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 181,
        "text": "What happened next shocked me even more, because with the income from us, the farmers actually started to invest in better practices, better equipment, investing in their own farms.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "49617A8B93",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "the right economics",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "34316C2E1C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "the right economics was more powerful than the right knowledge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "71E25F780B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "And you know what else?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8F80CF1A4E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "Supposedly, young people are not very interested in agriculture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC34FB9762",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "That is not true.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86797E4B0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Young people in Kenya love agriculture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F86E7CB302",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "But what they love even more is to have a decent job and earn a decent income.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA97D18325",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "At FarmWorks, more than 80 percent of our employees are under the age of 30.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04DFACB609",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "We are an agriculture business made by young talent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8278E41EF8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "Over the years, we have grown into one of the largest vegetable wholesalers in Kenya.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "353ABB011D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "In 2024, we sold 100 million tomatoes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C69D724738",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "That might sound like a lot.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E453DAD683",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "(Laughs) (Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CBB0F9291",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "It's barely two tomatoes per person in Kenya.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E85E623C0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "So we still have a lot of room to grow and a long way to go.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A87A327F1E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "And remember my original dream of building 1,000 farms.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA20FEAA3E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "That is still being realized, but in a different way.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B80D7436E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "Today, the farms are being built not by us but by the farmers, who know their own land and communities the best.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F948C24D41",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "With steady market uptake and consistent income from us, they are now able to invest in their own farms and reach out to us when they need help.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3DC2FAD3ED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "Finding financial sustainability was not easy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0087310AC6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "For years after finding our market, we were still bleeding money.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8327B466A5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "I had to make difficult decisions of shutting down prized demonstration farms, halting new partnerships, even closing regions that were too far away for us to serve.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5CEA63141B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "Turns out it was really difficult to save money, compared to spending it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FBB92EED06",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "But I knew the only way for us to survive and grow our impact is through finding financial sustainability.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BDA8EAA0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "Today, we're a business with healthy margins and growth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2D2853348",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "More than 300 employees work for us, and more than 10,000 market vendors rely on us for their daily supplies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "838A55F75A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 80,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "real sustainability",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7F535473C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "The hard lesson I learned from the years of being a social entrepreneur is that real sustainability, climate or otherwise, must come from economics first.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2394424980",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 215,
        "text": "I'm not talking about choosing profit over planet, but I have recognized that without a viable economics, our climate projects and initiatives might remain as expensive experiments but not really scalable solutions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D30390A26",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Think about it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "401C81B229",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "When farmers earn an income",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F09B78142",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "When farmers earn an income, they can invest in better practices.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25ABE163E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "When companies achieve profitability",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EA9FCFA084",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "When companies achieve profitability, we can protect and scale our impact.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57FB01FA79",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "When communities prosper economically",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E1B7BE8A87",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "When communities prosper economically, they're able and can afford to care about their environment in the long term.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "434E1D1900",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "So here is my message.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6335754A14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "The best thing we can do for our climate is to build economically viable solutions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5050081349",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "Let there be economics first.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81C89C2296",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "Then, and only then, can we unlock real, lasting climate impact.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B6CEDC44A2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D4D59C807D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Cheers and applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "622389FFBB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}